    "detailed_description": "<strong>Experience the adventure of a lifetime through the eyes of Jeffy.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT THE GREEN BEANS, COLLECT THE CEREAL BOXES, AND CLAIM VICTORY!</h2>Each carefully crafted level will leave you wanting more with its innovative puzzle elements and thought-provoking worlds. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357760/extras/9b71fde3ec2c57c9c05ae435d4d2e716.poster.avif?t=1698302923\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357760/extras/9b71fde3ec2c57c9c05ae435d4d2e716.webm?t=1698302923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357760/extras/9b71fde3ec2c57c9c05ae435d4d2e716.mp4?t=1698302923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES?</h2>Throughout your journey you will encounter different types of enemies and obstacles that you must overcome. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357760/extras/58794ae54573b26ada82592e520b5ba3.poster.avif?t=1698302923\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357760/extras/58794ae54573b26ada82592e520b5ba3.webm?t=1698302923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357760/extras/58794ae54573b26ada82592e520b5ba3.mp4?t=1698302923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECRET LEVEL!</h2>If you collect all of the hidden cereal boxes you will unlock a secret level in which you will discover lore relating to the Kable10 universe. After you have finished the game you can also unlock <i>Golden Jeffy</i> which allows for even more replayability and fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357760/extras/42eaba71df99fcf7573bb29c5f632a81.avif?t=1698302923\" /></span>",
